# CDK
cdk.out/
# Real per-tenant deploy parameters (githubOwner, alarmsEmail, appDomain,
# adminEmail, hostedDomain, ...) live here for a real deployment — see
# infra/cdk.context.example.json and infra/README.md "Deploy identity
# context" (issue #409). CDK auto-creates this file (starting empty, {})
# on first synth; the structural, brand-free AZ-lookup cache CDK also needs
# for an offline synth lives in the committed infra/cdk.json instead, so
# this file never needs to be committed for tests/CI to pass.
cdk.context.json
cdk.context.json.bak
.cdk.staging/

