# Generated: the Orbit Diner mockup page inlines every image as base64 (3.6 MB).
# Rebuild with `python3 docs/assets/orbit-diner-mockup/build.py`.
docs/assets/orbit-diner-mockup/mockup.html

# Orbit Diner (epic #729). The tracked source of record is
# frontend/vendor/orbit-diner/ (2.3 MB, see its README). The 129 MB of supplier
# drops — PNG masters, preview bundles, reference renders, their tooling — is
# archived outside the repo at
# ~/Dev/_vendor-archive/contract-toaster/orbit-diner/2026-09-07/.
# These patterns keep a future drop from cluttering `git status` and from being
# swept up by a careless `git add -A`. (They would not have blocked the
# autonomous loop: its sync gate ignores "??" lines.)
frontend/orbit-diner-*/
frontend/orbit-diner-*.zip
frontend/orbit-diner-handoff.md
